Measuring Methane Emissions in Ambient Air with a Low-Cost, Portable Sensor System: Focus on Scalability and Transferability of the Model
Lorenzo Bertin 1,*, Matteo Mentasti 2 , Fabrizio Pittorino 2, Veronica Villa 1, Emanuele Zanni 2 , Gabriele Viscardi 2, Yuri Ponzani 3, Andrea Massara 4, Manuel Roveri 2, Raffaele Dellaca’ 2 and Laura Capelli 1
